      "dss": "∀ x. ∀ y. (IsSemigroup(x, y)) ↔ ((IsSet(x)) ∧ (IsMap(y, x × x, x)) ∧ (∀ z. ∀ x_1. ∀ y_1. (z ∈ x) → (x_1 ∈ x) → (y_1 ∈ x) → ((op(y, op(y, z, x_1), y_1)) = (op(y, z, op(y, x_1, y_1))))))",
