      "dss": "∀ x. ∀ y. ∀ z. (IsMonoid(x, y, z)) ↔ ((IsSemigroup(x, y)) ∧ (z ∈ x) ∧ (∀ x_1. (x_1 ∈ x) → (((op(y, z, x_1)) = x_1) ∧ ((op(y, x_1, z)) = x_1))))",
